            <h2>Tips for housing</h2>
            <p>- Security Deposit: Landlords often require a deposit before moving in.</p>
<p>- Home Insurance: Many landlords require tenants to have home insurance.</p>
<p>- Electricity: You may need to arrange your own electricity contract.</p>
